        "title": "“Where is…?”",
        "body": [
          "**…iko wapi?** ni **Where is…?** Neno la swali huja mwanzoni: **Where is the bank?**",
          "Majibu: **It’s near the church.** (Iko karibu na kanisa.) **It’s far.** (Iko mbali.) **It’s here.** (Iko hapa.)"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "going-to",
        "title": "“I am going to…”",
        "body": [
          "**Ninaenda mjini** ni **I am going to town.** Tumia **to** kabla ya mahali: **to school**, **to the market**.",
          "Lakini **home** haichukui **to**: **I am going home.** Kuuliza: **Where are you going?** (Unaenda wapi?)"
        ]
      }
    ],
